721 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 318 0 R
/E (In conclusion, the XploreQuest project aims to develop a secure mobile adventure application that prevents cheating, validates checkpoints through geofencing and dynamic QR codes, and ensures offline capability. These objectives focus on solving manual verification bottlenecks and GPS location spoofing. I hope this project establishes a solid foundation for future development in Final Year Project 2. I believe XploreQuest can improve event security, operational efficiency, and trust for outdoor races.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
